Post-apocalyptic rules (wn-apocalypse): an Open Character Format pack
================================================================================

This pack models the character rules of Ashes Without Number, by Kevin Crawford,
published by Sine Nomine Publishing. Its text comes from the game's free
edition and is used with the author's permission (license:
LicenseRef-sine-nomine-free-edition). Whoever shares the pack's content must
pass on its credit and notices:

Text from Ashes Without Number (Free Edition), © 2025 Sine Nomine Publishing,
Inc., by Kevin Crawford. Used with the author's permission.

The content of the free edition of Ashes Without Number is reproduced here with
the author's permission; nothing from the game's paid edition is included.

Ashes Without Number is a game by Kevin Crawford, published by Sine Nomine
Publishing. This pack is an unofficial model of its character rules: it is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Sine Nomine Publishing.

The free edition's text, names and tables remain the property of Sine Nomine
Publishing, Inc.; the permission covers their use in this pack, not a license
to reuse them elsewhere.

The Open Character Format contributors' own work in this pack (its data
structure, formulas and the labels written for it) is dedicated to the public
domain under CC0 1.0 Universal, the default for packs in the Open Character
Format repository that declare no license of their own (packs/LICENSE). CC0
covers only that work.
